Yes, and I had no success either. AFAIK the SRM v5.8 emulator is unable to
run the x86 radeon bios. This problem is fixed in SRM v5.9, which
unfortunately never came out for the UP2000. And booting through AlphaBios
instead of SRM would require MILO, which does not exist for UP2000 either.
So there is not much hope left.

	Oliver


