From Jay.Estabrook at hp.com  Wed Oct 27 15:03:30 2004
From: Jay.Estabrook at hp.com (Jay Estabrook)
Date: Wed, 27 Oct 2004 11:03:30 -0400
Subject: KZPEA bios?
